WEBVTT

00:30:58.290 --> 00:31:01.288
and you wake up,
and you're still in your office.

00:31:01.312 --> 00:31:04.212
The walls could be
closing in a little bit,

00:31:04.236 --> 00:31:07.319
and I definitely felt that
on my six-month flight.

00:31:07.890 --> 00:31:09.410
AG: Under normal circumstances,

00:31:09.434 --> 00:31:11.706
conventional wisdom
is to be in the present,

00:31:11.730 --> 00:31:13.155
live in the moment,

00:31:13.179 --> 00:31:14.591
seize the day.

00:31:15.178 --> 00:31:18.526
But in isolation, sometimes the day sucks,

00:31:18.550 --> 00:31:20.395
especially in outer space.

00:31:21.498 --> 00:31:24.165
(Music)

00:31:26.290 --> 00:31:30.271
SK: I also missed nature, going outside,